an to Tilt Republican.","when":"2026-10-20","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Harry Enten","what":"On Anderson Cooper 360 he said polling in the Kansas Senate race is tied and listed it among the races that could hand Democrats a majority.","when":"2026-10-22","lean":"nonpartisan"}],"donorSignal":{"z":0.309,"parts":{"instate":1.818,"breadth":0.749,"small":-0.613,"reach":-0.716},"shift_logit":0.0,"applies":false},"research":{"summary":"Republican Sen. Roger Marshall faces Adam Hamilton, a centrist United Methodist megachurch pastor who left the GOP in April, in a race Cook rates a toss up and that KCUR reports is neck and neck. Hamilton is running on fuel costs, tariffs and the Iran war plus Marshall's medical debt lawsuits, while Marshall, endorsed by Trump, ties Hamilton to Chuck Schumer and attacks his church's handling of a 2005 abuse report.","issues":[{"issue":"Fuel and diesel prices","why":"Diesel is up 79 percent from a year ago during the Iran war, squeezing farmers and ranchers, and Marshall predicts prices will fall once the war ends.","src":"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/kansas-senate-adam-hamilton-roger-marshall-campaign-iran-gas-prices/"},{"issue":"Tariffs and farm trade","why":"Hamilton calls tariffs an unpredictable tax that hurts business, while Marshall says they bring jobs home.","src":"https://www.kcur.org/politics-elections-and-government/2026-10-21/control-of-the-senate-goes-through-kansas-marshall-and-hamilton-clash-at-last-debate"},{"issue":"Health care costs","why":"Hamilton would expand ACA subsidies, while Marshall says Medicaid is broken and the ACA is unaffordable.","src":"https://www.kcur.org/politics-elections-and-government/2026-10-21/control-of-the-senate-goes-through-kansas-marshall-and-hamilton-clash-at-last-debate"},{"issue":"Immigration enforcement","why":"Unannounced ICE raids in southwest Kansas drew criticism, and Marshall said ICE needs to coordinate with local police.","src":"https://time.com/article/2026/10/07/why-kansas-has-emerged-as-a-new-battleground-state-and-why-it-matters/"},{"issue":"Beef imports and ranchers","why":"Ranchers were angered by Trump's plan to import foreign beef, and the Kansas Livestock Association PAC declined to endorse Marshall.","src":"https://time.com/article/2026/10/07/why-kansas-has-emerged-as-a-new-battleground-state-and-why-it-matters/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Final debate on FOX4","date":"2026-10-21","what":"Marshall said control of the Senate goes through Kansas and tied Hamilton to Schumer, while Hamilton called tariffs and the Iran war sources of chaos and corruption.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.kcur.org/politics-elections-and-government/2026-10-21/control-of-the-senate-goes-through-kansas-marshall-and-hamilton-clash-at-last-debate"},{"title":"Marshall ad on 2005 church abuse case","date":"2026-10-21","what":"A Marshall ad called Hamilton a pedophile protector over how his church handled a 2005 abuse report, and Hamilton said the church helped imprison the perpetrator but he should have checked more.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.kcur.org/politics-elections-and-government/2026-10-21/control-of-the-senate-goes-through-kansas-marshall-and-hamilton-clash-at-last-debate"},{"title":"Trump rallies near Wichita","date":"2026-10-19","what":"Trump campaigned for Marshall in Park City as early polls showed a 45 to 45 tie.","helps":"R","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.kcur.org/politics-elections-and-government/2026-10-21/control-of-the-senate-goes-through-kansas-marshall-and-hamilton-clash-at-last-debate"},{"title":"Cook moves race to toss up","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Cook shifted the race to toss up, as the Senate Leadership Fund reserved 8.2 million dollars and Marshall's side held a large ad money edge.","helps":"D","kind":"national","src":"https://time.com/article/2026/10/07/why-kansas-has-emerged-as-a-new-battleground-state-and-why-it-matters/"},{"title":"Billboards mock Marshall's Florida home","date":"2026-09-30","